<title>USA: Primark says sets up to 1 mln share buy-back.</title>
<headline>Primark says sets up to 1 mln share buy-back.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Primark Corp said Wednesday its board of directors has authorized the repurchase of up to one million shares of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it intends to immediately commence the program and repurchase shares from time to time in the open market and/or in privately negotiated transactions.</p>
</text>
